ager_emails\": \"array of strings\",   \"address_type\": \"string\",   \"created_user_id\": \"string\",   \"created_user_name\": \"string\",   \"customer_notes\": \"string\",   \"dependency\": \"boolean\",   \"driver_notes\": \"array of strings\",   \"height\": \"integer\",   \"is_quote_order\": \"boolean\",   \"is_smp_applied\": \"boolean\",   \"length\": \"integer\",   \"location_appointments\": [     {       \"location_id\": \"string\",       \"start_datetime\": \"datetime\",       \"end_datetime\": \"datetime\",       \"slot_name\": \"string\",       \"type_of_order\": \"string\"     }   ],   \"location_partial_match\": \"boolean\",   \"multiday\": \"boolean\",   \"pallets\": \"integer\",   \"quotation_amount\": \"integer\",   \"reference_1_type\": \"string\",   \"reference_2\": \"string\",   \"reference_2_type\": \"string\",   \"reference_3\": \"string\",   \"reference_3_type\": \"string\",   \"surface_area\": \"integer\",   \"total_no_of_cubes\": \"integer\",   \"version\": \"integer\",   \"wh_storage\": \"boolean\",   \"width\": \"integer\",   \"has_recovery\": \"boolean\",   \"has_release\": \"boolean\",   \"is_lh_order\": \"boolean\",   \"lh_order_ids\": \"array of strings\",   \"recovery_status\": \"string\",   \"references\": \"array of strings\",   \"references_list\": \"array of strings\",   \"release_status\": \"string\",   \"release_type\": \"string\",   \"required_accessorials\": \"array of strings\",   \"reason_for_manual_update\": \"array of strings\",   \"source_files\": \"array of strings\",   \"sum_of_items_dim_weight\": \"integer\",   \"sum_of_items_weight\": \"integer\",   \"warehouse_status\": \"string\",   \"order_label\": \"string\" }  Based on the user's plain English request, generate the appropriate MongoDB query using any required operators (comparison, logical, array, aggregation, etc.) include $project in the query if it is required and maintain consistent output without any additional text.  User request: {{ $json.chatInput }}"
